│                            ││   ### What changed                                                 │
│                            ││                                                                    │
│                            ││   • Added  Retry  with exponential backoff and jitter              │
│                            ││   • Moved the timeout handling into the helper                     │
│                            ││   • Deleted the legacy  retryForever  function                     │
│                            ││                                                                    │
│                            ││   ### Example                                                      │
│                            ││                                                                    │
│                            ││     err := Retry(ctx, 5, func() error {                            │
│                            ││         return client.Sync(ctx)                                    │
│                            ││     })                                                             │
│                            ││                                                                    │
│                            ││   ### Notes                                                        │
│                            ││                                                                    │
│                            ││   The backoff starts at 100ms and doubles up to a cap of           │
│                            ││   10s. See the design doc for why jitter matters when many         │
│                            ││   clients restart at once, and the follow-up issue for             │
│                            ││   making the policy configurable.                                  │
